Dear WinDRBD and DRBD users,

We've just released WinDRBD 1.0.0-rc7, which is now based on DRBD 9.0.25 and therefore contains the latest patches from the upstream DRBD source. We are getting closer to 1.0.0, so please help testing these releases these days,

As always the WinDRBD install packages can be downloaded from:

https://www.linbit.com/linbit-software-download-page-for-linstor-and-drbd-linux-driver/#windrbd

Best wishes,

- Johannes

